          "year": 2004,
          "date_decided": "2004-04-28",
          "holding": "The court held that sovereign immunity did not bar, at the pleading stage, the claim that CYFD failed before adoption to disclose the child's known dangerous tendencies, but affirmed dismissal of the claims based on CYFD's post-adoption knowledge and conduct.",
